Package: ProteoAnalystR
Title: ProteoAnalystR
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
           person(given = "Jeff",
           family = "Xia",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jeff.xia@mcgill.ca"
           )
           )
Description: Underlying R functions for the ProteoAnalyst web server, covering
    proteomics and phosphoproteomics data processing, differential analysis,
    enrichment analysis, biomarker exploration and network-based interpretation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.0.3), igraph, RColorBrewer, qs2, rjson, RSQLite, ggplot2, Cairo
